WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.064
A friendly letter includes an address or location, date, greeting, message and

00:00:05.064 --> 00:00:05.875
suitable closing.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:11.671
What should open a friendly letter? Answer: A suitable greeting such as Dear Esi,

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:17.227
Write a letter to a friend describing a school activity and inviting a reply.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:20.956
Discuss why: A greeting addresses the recipient.
